# Portfolio repo maintenance

## Keep lean
- Never commit `.next/`, `node_modules/`, `.vercel/`, `next-env.d.ts`, or `*.tsbuildinfo`
- Do not add App Hub / company monorepo code into this portfolio
- Prefer editing content in `app/data/*` over scattering copy across components

## Public assets
- `public/profile.jpg` — your photo
- `public/KarunaVasu_Resume.pdf` — designed resume (site download)
- Do **not** keep parallel designed resumes (`*_Updated_AppHub.pdf`, ATS duplicates, old Python Developer PDFs)
- Keep resume generators / fonts / photo source outside this repo (`Desktop/KV`), not in git

## README
- Short personal landing (live URL + role). No “how to run / deploy” tutorials for strangers.

## Designation
- Official title in UI and resume copy: **Software Engineer**
